# Matrix multiply-accumulate C[m x n] += A[m x k] * B[k x n] with bf16 A and B and an f32 C
# (row-major, contiguous). On the LLVM backend `mm` uses AMX tiles on Sapphire/Granite Rapids,
# SME outer products on SME CPUs, and full-width vector FMAs elsewhere.
fn gemm_bf16(c:ptr, a:ptr, b:ptr, m:i64, n:i64, k:i64)
  b0:
    mm c, a, b, m, n, k:bf16
    ret
